00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:06.706
Hitotose

00:01:00.494 --> 00:01:04.863
The reason I jumped out the window

00:01:06.767 --> 00:01:11.670
Was because the deep blue sky
was so clear

00:01:13.107 --> 00:01:17.237
I was still uncertain
about the self I couldn't see

00:01:18.312 --> 00:01:24.046
So I plunged out here, barefoot

00:01:25.185 --> 00:01:30.891
There are things I can't explain
or do well

00:01:30.891 --> 00:01:36.761
That lie beyond the mirror
that I stare at so intently

00:01:37.798 --> 00:01:43.270
So I put my rumpled-up dream
in my pocket

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:50.377
And make a promise to myself in the sky,
ten years from now

00:01:50.377 --> 00:01:55.983
The future I've always believed in
is no mistake

00:01:55.983 --> 00:02:02.356
Because I'm sure I have stronger
feelings than anyone else

